# joshuasuzuki.com

- Stack: vanilla JS, npm, bash scripts, AWS SAM for Lambdas. Do not introduce Make, mise, pnpm, or a SPA framework unless asked.
- Before finishing work, run `./scripts/verify.sh` (or `npm test`). Fix failures; do not skip or quarantine without asking.
- Never run production deploy (`deploy.sh`, `/deploy-all`, or `gh workflow run deploy.yml`) unless the human explicitly requests it.
- Never commit secrets, `.env`, ESPN session cookies (`espn_s2`, `SWID`), Firecrawl keys, or IAM live credentials.
- Do not commit `SOFTWARE_FACTORY_PLAN.md` unless a human asks.
- PR description should follow `.github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md`.
